@HuwRichards ,
Hi Huw, big Fan of your gardening. Love the channel!
But to the matter at hand: havd you heard about Johnson-Su compost? It is THE best microbial inoculant for soils. A Fungally dominant and highly diverse microbial community. It is a static pile that is left to work for 9 months to 1 year. Have you wcer tried it? I would love to know what you think about it!

text_original:
I am on food stamps, I have been on UNPAID FMLA since March with Leukemia, I get 200/month but DO NOT SPEND all of it each month to feed myself, so I always have extra on the card and for those that do not know, IT STAYS there until it is used up. So, each month you get NEW snap it keeps adding up and up and up.  Once it is on your card, unless you have committed fraud, by not reporting income, you will KEEP it until you use it.  Just because you have it, doesn't mean you are incapable of making a budget each month, you do not have to spend EVERY penny EVERY month. But, when stuff is free, most people will engorge themselves like gluttons, which is why in all of these videos, the women are obese and then claiming my children are starving!!  Well, then YOU stop eating the 12 ding dongs every day and feed your kids!  OR stop having 9 kids with no husband and no job!

@the woman at 5:00  the country is a joke because??? The govt is TEMPORARILY shut down and you are not getting your food stamps?  Tell me you maroon, if you were in a poor country in Africa, you would NOT be getting ANY food stamps to be TEMPORARILY stopped from, you wouldn't jbe receiving ANYTHING from those governments!! The AMERICAN POOR people make around 16K per year and there are only 53 COUNTRIES in the world whose average income is higher than that! So, out of some 290 countries in the world, the average INCOME of the American poor 16K/year, is 54th in the world! 

So, STFU!!!!!

